  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>In the first step ethyl benzene undergoes electrophilic substitution reaction to form&nbsp;1-Bromo-4-ethylbenzene.</p><p>In the next&nbsp;step&nbsp;1-Bromo-4-ethylbenzene undergoes free radical substitution at benzylic position followed by dehydrohalogenation(last step) in presence of alcoholic KOH to form 4-bromo styrene.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0099_daa48429fde8.png\" style=\"width: 430px; height: 510px;\" /></p>"
